I want you to hear the truth from me as  much as I can share not as a prince or  joke but as hairy it was in front of  friends that Prince Harry broke his  silence at a private dinner for his  charity center Bali he explained why he  and Megan had to step down from their  royal roles we both do everything we can  to fly the flag and carried out our  roles for this country with pride  once Megan and I were married we were  incited we were hopeful and we were here  to serve for those reasons it brings me  great sadness that it has come to this  the decision that I have made for my  wife and I to step back is not one I  made lightly  there was so many months of talks after  so many years of challenges and I know I  haven't always done it right but as far  as this goes there really was no other  option describing how they had wanted to  continue their royal work but also how  the media had pushed them away what I  want to make clear is we're not walking  away and we certainly aren't walking  away from you our hope was to continue  serving the Queen the Commonwealth and  my military associations but without  public funding unfortunately that wasn't  possible the media is a powerful force  and my hope is one day our collective  support for each other can be more  powerful because this is so much bigger  than just us  his speech came just 24 hours after  queen who was seen going to church in  Norfolk on Sunday had given her blessing  to a deal that would allow Harry and  Megan to have this new independent life  no press were invited for his speech  instead it was filmed for the couple's  Instagram account very different to what  his mother faced in 1993 when she  announced she was stepping down but his  reasons for going are strikingly similar  I understood the media might be  interested in what I did but I was not  aware of how overwhelming that attention  would become when they got engaged this  was a couple excited about what they  could achieve together it hasn't been  the fairy tale we'd all built it up to  be and in this next chapter there was no  chance of being part time Royals a  sacrifice that Harry has sadly had to  make for his dream of a peaceful new  family life Rhiannon Mills Sky News at  Buckingham Palace
 

